%F A402479 G.f.: Sum_{k>=1} Product_{j=1..k} x^(2*j)*(1 + x^(4*j))*(1 + x^(4*j-1))*(1 + x^(4*j-2))*(1 + x^(4*j-3)).
%F A402479 a(n) ~ c * d^sqrt(n) / sqrt(n), where d = 3.9419717412206815932... (the same as in A402468) and c = 0.170597279241572168...
%t A402479 nmax = 100; CoefficientList[Series[Sum[x^(k*(k+1))*Product[1+x^j, {j, 1, 4*k}], {k, 1, Sqrt[nmax]}], {x, 0, nmax}], x]
